    <guid isPermaLink="false">676a13e41e823e72d33bb59c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Dec 2024 02:12:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听映声FM第8期，这次我们和“间奏时间”播客带来一期特别的共创对谈节目，也是映声FM第一期“嘉宾篇”，和音乐界的资深从业者和创作者Draco，共同分享作为音乐创作者的感悟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a></span></strong><span> - 创作者对关注度的追求及其对创作的影响</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a></span></strong><span> - 回顾内地神曲的发展，比较不同年代的流行歌曲</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a></span></strong><span> - 音乐传播形式从唱片到数字平台的变迁</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a></span></strong><span> - 独立音乐人如何适应新的传播载体和市场</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a></span></strong><span> - 视频在音乐传播中的作用</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a></span></strong><span> - Draco分享自己的工作和创作的经历</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a></span></strong><span> - 商业需求和个人创作之间的平衡</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a></span></strong><span> - 以音乐为职业的现实问题</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a></span></strong><span> - 行业外对音乐行业成功的误解</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a></span></strong><span> - 歌词在音乐创作中的重要性</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a></span></strong><span> - 乐理作为音乐人之间沟通的语言</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a></span></strong><span> - Jannie Kyo和Draco分别推荐自己喜欢的专辑</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
